# capability_grant_use — capability declaration and use
# (README §12). Tests effect declaration with matching capability: the write
# effect is permitted only because main `uses` a capability that `grants` it.
#
# Correctness observation: the line is written through a capability-covered
# effect; drop `uses stdoutWriter` and the gate rejects the program.
# Expected output: Capability OK

CapabilityGrantUse is project
CapabilityGrantUse module examplesCapabilityGrantUse
CapabilityGrantUse target console
CapabilityGrantUse entry main

examplesCapabilityGrantUse is module
examplesCapabilityGrantUse path examples.capabilityGrantUse
examplesCapabilityGrantUse exports main
examplesCapabilityGrantUse purpose "Demonstrate capability declaration and use"
examplesCapabilityGrantUse invariant "Capabilities match declared effects"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Use capability-backed effect"
main invariant "Capability and effect match"

main let message immutable String "Capability OK"
main let harnessName immutable String "capability_grant_use"
main let harnessExpected immutable String "Capability OK"
main let emptyGuard immutable String ""
main let noopName immutable String "capability_grant_use: real result (not the empty string)"

main do writeMsg
main do noopCheck
main do harnessReport
main return harnessSummaryCode

writeMsg is call
writeMsg in main
writeMsg invokes test.assertEqualText
writeMsg arg name String harnessName
writeMsg arg expected String harnessExpected
writeMsg arg actual String message


noopCheck is call
noopCheck in main
noopCheck invokes test.assertNotEqualText
noopCheck arg name String noopName
noopCheck arg expected String emptyGuard
noopCheck arg actual String message

harnessReport is call
harnessReport in main
harnessReport invokes test.summary
harnessReport out harnessSummaryCode ExitCode